---
// The biography below is deliberately limited to what's verifiable from the
// decisions log: real stack breadth, the AI/ML and Web3 work, and the
// annotation background. No employers, dates, or achievements are asserted —
// those need to come from Praise.
const tags = [
  'Full-Stack',
  'AI / ML',
  'Web3',
  'TypeScript',
  'Solidity',
  'Ex-annotator',
];
---

<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div class="about-head reveal-left">
      <p class="eyebrow mono">About</p>
      <h2>Broad by choice,<br /><span class="italic-accent">not by accident.</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body reveal-right">
      <p>
        I work across the whole stack — React and Next on the front, Node and
        Postgres behind it, Solidity where the problem needs a chain, and Python
        when there's a model involved. That range isn't a list of things I've
        touched once; it's the shape of the work I take on.
      </p>

      <p>
        Before I was writing the applications, I was annotating the data they
        learn from — image, video, and text labelling for AI training sets. It's
        the least visible thing I've done and probably the most useful: it's
        where I learned how much of "AI-powered" is actually data quality, and
        how quickly a model falls apart on inputs nobody thought to label.
      </p>

      <p>
        I care most about the parts of a build that are hard to see — the
        decisions that make something fast, accessible, and still maintainable a
        year later.
      </p>

      <ul class="about-tags">
        {tags.map((tag) => <li class="tag">{tag}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.9rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-body p + p {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .about-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .about-body {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
